Stream-compress build-seed metal-sources archives to .img.zst by default with bidirectional .img/.img.zst read compatibility, bounded-chunk zstd wrapper (compression.zstd, backports.zstd, zstandard, zstd CLI), and scan-uncompressed / compress-seeds CLI subcommands.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Stream-compress build-seed metal-sources archives with zstd and expose scan-uncompressed/compress-seeds CLI
Issue: none

